# WhenPanel Styling

Preserve these styles when editing WhenPanel. Do not change values without explicit request.

## Layout

- Root: `space-y-3` container (quick dates, custom repeat, calendar + time)
- Calendar + time: `flex flex-col items-start gap-1.5` (calendar, then time on the next row)
- Calendar: `FillaMiniCalendar` (`variant="sidebar"`, `bare`, `defaultExpanded={false}`, `className="min-w-0 shrink-0"`) — no card chrome; left-aligned
- Time: `DueTimePressedPicker` on the row below
- WhenSection editor shell: `pt-4 pb-3 space-y-2` (more space above date, room under time; no left indent)
- Bare mini-calendar: no expand/collapse height animation (instant month ↔ week swap)

## Calendar

Use the left-rail mini-calendar, not the old 110px date strip.

- Week-strip swipe/scroll is required (`defaultExpanded={false}`)
- Do not pass `onMonthTitleClick` (must stay in create/edit)
- Do not switch to `variant="embedded"` — that variant is not collapsible and loses the week strip

## Time selector (`DueTimePressedPicker`)

Simpler than the old 3-row blur wheels. Three 30×30 `rounded-card` tiles matching mini-calendar day geometry.

- Hour / minute: `bg-white shadow-btn-pressed`, `font-mono text-sm`
- Colon: `font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-muted-foreground`
- AM/PM: `bg-primary text-[10px] text-primary-foreground shadow-btn-pressed`, tap toggles
- Hour popover: 4-column grid of 1–12
- Minute popover: 2-column grid of 00 / 15 / 30 / 45
- Popover: `z-[120] rounded-xl border-0 bg-card p-2 shadow-e1` (must sit above dialog `z-[110]`)
- Time caption: `CALENDAR_MONTH_TITLE_CLASS` (`h-5 mb-1`, left-aligned; no top pad — stacked under calendar)
- Time column: `pb-1` for breathing room under the tiles

## Quick Date Buttons

- Font: `font-mono text-2xs uppercase tracking-wider`
- Padding: `px-1.5 py-0.5`, border-radius: `rounded-[4px]`
- Container: `flex flex-nowrap gap-1 h-6`
- Active: `bg-card text-foreground` with inset shadow
- Inactive: `bg-background text-muted-foreground` with raised shadow, hover to inset
